---
name: Admin global access
description: All administrators can see all fazendas and all data, regardless of administrador_id linkage
type: feature
---
RLS policies for admin role use `public.is_admin(auth.uid())` which checks `EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM administradores WHERE user_id = _user_id AND ativo = true)`.
This replaced per-fazenda filtering via `fazendas.administrador_id`.
Applied to: fazendas, retiros, pastos, lancamentos, ciclos, ciclos_auditoria, abates, mortalidades, movimentacoes_animais, observacoes, snapshots, visitas, capatazes, gerentes, produtos.
